        "created_at": "2022-10-19T04:02:34.245Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>I’m trying to figure out how to get hold of the errata pack for Branch and Claw (reprint 3). I noticed that the Greater than Games store had this in stock back at the start of 2022 . However I couldn’t justify the postage cost at the time (I’m based in the UK). I now have a friend who is working in the US and happy to pick this up for me, but it seems to be completely gone from the store. Will it ever be back?</p>\n<p>Any information is welcome. Thanks.</p>",
